      "nb_ouvertures_90j            4.84  19.15  0.0  2557.0     43.76       0.0\n",
      "nb_desabo_90j                0.02   0.24  0.0    11.0     98.70       0.0\n",
      "nb_campagnes_recues          5.15   5.85  1.0    47.0      0.00       0.0\n",
      "nb_campagnes_cliquees        0.42   0.97  0.0    17.0     73.78       0.0\n",
      "nb_urls_distinctes_cliquees  0.68   2.25  0.0   143.0     73.78       0.0\n",
      "taux_clic_sur_ouverture      0.15   0.58  0.0    37.0     77.41       0.0\n",
      "a_interagi_email             0.56   0.50  0.0     1.0     43.76       0.0\n",
      "recence_email_jours          5.91  13.05  0.0    90.0     53.58       0.0\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "Taux d'annulation selon l'interaction email :\n",
      "                          nb  taux\n",
      "Pas d'interaction (0)  16668  8.04\n",
      "A interagi (1)         21424  6.53\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "Corrélations features email → y_annulation :\n",
      "     a_interagi_email                    -0.0291\n",
      "     nb_ouvertures_90j                   -0.0130\n",
      "     nb_campagnes_cliquees               -0.0076\n",
      "     taux_clic_sur_ouverture             +0.0052\n",
      "     nb_desabo_90j                       +0.0051\n",
      "     nb_campagnes_recues                 -0.0032\n",
      "     recence_email_jours                 +0.0022\n",
