      "\n",
      "                               AUC-ROC  PR-AUC      F1  Précision  Rappel\n",
      "Modèle A (structurel)           0.7234  0.2492  0.2792     0.2061  0.4325\n",
      "Modèle B (structurel + email)   0.7530  0.2618  0.3087     0.2373  0.4416\n",
      "Δ (B - A)                       0.0296  0.0126  0.0295     0.0312  0.0091\n",
      "\n",
